{
  "env": "prod",
  "account_id": "f011d0ee02b23cad26b4b38151b204ad",
  "zone": "yonedarepo.com",
  "workers_subdomain": "mlong-f01",
  "prefix": "yonedarepo-prod",
  "ref": "main",
  "secrets_file": "~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env",
  "vars": {
    "origin": "https://yonedarepo.com",
    "ratelimit": "1001",
    "public_ratelimit": "1002"
  },
  "check_instances": 4,
  "workers": [
    {
      "role": "superfan",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-superfan.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production superfan: the cheap-model watcher (cloudflare/superfan) of the production platform",
        "Worker (yonedarepo-prod-platform), with its own ledger and a $1/day cap. It keeps the platform's tail",
        "events and, hourly, reads the GraphQL Analytics API. The Durable Object namespace, queue and",
        "CheckContainer ids it queries are looked up by name at run time (no ids in this config), so",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN needs Account Analytics Read plus Workers Scripts Read, Queues Read and",
        "Containers Read (all read-only). Secrets, set from stdin (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env):",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN  API token with the read permissions above",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN bearer for GET /findings, GET /status, POST /run",
        "Deployed first: the production platform names this Worker in tail_consumers."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN"
      ],
      "ephemeral": false,
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-superfan",
        "main": "superfan/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "triggers": {
          "crons": [
            "7 * * * *"
          ]
        },
        "vars": {
          "CF_ACCOUNT_ID": "{account_id}",
          "WATCH_SCRIPT": "{prefix}-platform",
          "WATCH_URL": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "TELEMETRY_SOURCE": "cloudflare",
          "SUPERFAN_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "MIMO_TOKEN_PLAN_REGION": "sgp",
          "DAILY_CAP_MICROUSD": "1000000"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "LEDGER",
              "class_name": "SuperfanLedger"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SuperfanLedger"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "platform",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-platform.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production platform Worker (yonedarepo.com): the same source platform as dev's",
        "(infra/envs/dev.json), with its own Durable Object namespaces, Artifacts namespace, R2, D1,",
        "queues, workflow, check containers and secrets. Browsers reach it through the front Worker's",
        "/api/v1 proxy (PLATFORM service binding); api.yonedarepo.com is its own hostname (Custom",
        "Domain plus the exact route);",
        "WEB_ORIGIN is where people approve device logins (/device). Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  production owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env)",
        "Placed next to the data (aws:us-east-1, R2 and CheckContainer in ENAM), batched landing.",
        "PUSH_BUNDLES=on writes a large push's objects as bundles (one R2 object per batch, indexed by the repository authority); dev measured a 12,000-file push at 4.9 s (489 s without). Turn it off before rolling back below the bundle reader.",
        "BLOB_WRITE_THROUGH=on writes each API commit's blobs to R2 after the commit's own I/O, so burst read-backs skip the commit shards; off leaves them to the shard drain. Off since 2026-10-28: 6 interleaved dev bursts gave land p95 1.7-2.1 s off vs 2.7-3.2 s on, with read p95 0.18-0.32 s off (target < 2 s).",
        "Check runs: one per invocation, up to check_instances (4) at once.",
        "Model checks call the review model with REVIEW_MODEL_KEY, the managed Z.ai key (Secrets Store",
        "secret ZAI), bound to the platform Worker itself.",
        "The production superfan (wrangler.prod-superfan.jsonc) receives this Worker's tail events.",
        "Git LFS (/git/<repo>.git/info/lfs) hands out presigned R2 URLs on the OBJECTS bucket's S3 API",
        "(LFS_S3_ENDPOINT, LFS_S3_BUCKET). Secrets: LFS_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID / LFS_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, the",
        "S3 key pair of an R2 API token with Object Read & Write on that bucket only. Without them LFS answers 501.",
        "Git over SSH (platform-ssh-gateway.ts): one SshGateway container (cloudflare/ssh-gateway/Dockerfile,",
        "its own image, never the runtime's) runs yoneda-ssh-gateway, reaching the platform only through SELF.",
        "SSH_FRONT_DOOR=off. tunnel: the container also runs cloudflared (SSH_TUNNEL_TOKEN, a remotely",
        "managed tunnel whose route sends ssh.yonedarepo.com to ssh://localhost:2222, with no Access application so",
        "`cloudflared access ssh` connects without a login); the cron below keeps it running (about $7 a",
        "month on basic). connect: inbound TCP to this Worker (Spectrum, private beta). off: no container.",
        "Secrets: SSH_GATEWAY_SECRET (32+ random characters), SSH_HOST_ED25519_KEY / SSH_HOST_ECDSA_KEY",
        "(base64 of OpenSSH host key files, generated once and kept). SSH_TUNNEL_TOKEN joins the secrets when prod turns the tunnel on.",
        "Welcome email (account-email.ts): the platform-jobs consumer sends one per new account through",
        "Resend (EMAIL_FROM, EMAIL_CONTACT). Its key is RESEND_API_KEY, the Secrets Store secret",
        "Resend-Yoneda, read at send time; without it email is off and sign-up never depends on it.",
        "The sending domain has open and click tracking off in Resend."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "LFS_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID",
        "LFS_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY",
        "SSH_GATEWAY_SECRET",
        "SSH_HOST_ED25519_KEY",
        "SSH_HOST_ECDSA_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo-platform",
      "always_on": {
        "SshGateway": "open SSH sessions"
      },
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-platform",
        "main": "worker/platform-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "tail_consumers": [
          {
            "service": "{prefix}-superfan"
          }
        ],
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "LAND_MODE": "batch",
          "BLOB_WRITE_THROUGH": "off",
          "PUSH_BUNDLES": "on",
          "WEB_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "WORKERS_SUBDOMAIN": "{subdomain}",
          "LFS_S3_ENDPOINT": "https://{account_id}.r2.cloudflarestorage.com",
          "LFS_S3_BUCKET": "{prefix}-platform-objects",
          "SSH_FRONT_DOOR": "off",
          "SSH_HOST": "ssh.yonedarepo.com",
          "EMAIL_FROM": "YonedaRepo <hello@yonedarepo.com>",
          "EMAIL_CONTACT": "hello@yonedarepo.com"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "REVIEW_MODEL_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          },
          {
            "binding": "RESEND_API_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "Resend-Yoneda"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "SOURCE_REPOS",
              "class_name": "SourceRepository"
            },
            {
              "name": "CHECK_RUNNERS",
              "class_name": "CheckContainer"
            },
            {
              "name": "OBJECT_PUSHES",
              "class_name": "ObjectPushQueue"
            },
            {
              "name": "COMMIT_SHARDS",
              "class_name": "CommitShard"
            },
            {
              "name": "LAND_COMBINERS",
              "class_name": "LandCombiner"
            },
            {
              "name": "SSH_GATEWAYS",
              "class_name": "SshGateway"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SourceRepository",
              "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "CheckContainer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "ObjectPushQueue"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "CommitShard"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v4",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "LandCombiner"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v5",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SshGateway"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "CheckContainer",
            "image": "./containers/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "instance_type": "standard-1",
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "class_name": "SshGateway",
            "image": "./ssh-gateway/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "instance_type": "basic",
            "max_instances": 2,
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-platform-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-platform-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs"
            },
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_CHECKS",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs",
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "max_batch_timeout": 1,
              "max_concurrency": 20,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "workflows": [
          {
            "name": "{prefix}-platform-import",
            "binding": "PLATFORM_IMPORT",
            "class_name": "PlatformImportWorkflow"
          }
        ],
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "PUBLIC_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{public_ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 300,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "api.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://api.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "triggers": {
          "crons": [
            "* * * * *"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "agents",
      "file": "wrangler.prod-agents.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Production front Worker (name kept from the agent layer, removed 2026-10-27): it serves the",
        "browser app on yonedarepo.com and www, account sign-in (/api/auth/*) and the owner session,",
        "and proxies /api/v1 to the production platform through the PLATFORM service binding on the",
        "same origin. Accounts live in the platform's WorkspaceAuthority (WORKSPACES script binding).",
        "It has no stores or containers; it only sends new accounts' welcome-email jobs to the platform-jobs queue. Secrets, set from stdin:",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  production owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/prod.env)",
        "The exact www route keeps www on this Worker; the apex is a Custom Domain.",
        "v4 deletes the agent layer's Durable Object classes (RepositoryAuthority, LiveRoom,",
        "AgentSandbox) and their data; the agent-run code is on the agent-run-workspaces branch."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-agents",
        "main": "worker/front-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "www.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://www.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN": "{origin}"
        },
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "script_name": "{prefix}-platform"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "RepositoryAuthority",
              "LiveRoom",
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "AgentSandbox"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "deleted_classes": [
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v4",
            "deleted_classes": [
              "RepositoryAuthority",
              "LiveRoom",
              "AgentSandbox"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "retired": {
    "notes": [
      "The Oct 14 single-Worker production (cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc layout) and its apps and sites",
      "Workers, from .local/deploy/production/platform.json and the old prod.json. Exact names only:",
      "the dev env is named yonedarepo-dev-* after the cutover, so no prefix may be used here.",
      "Its Durable Objects (and the ExecutionContainer app) go with the Worker; the Artifacts",
      "namespace has no delete, so prune empties it.",
      "Also the agent layer and website previews, removed 2026-10-27, by exact name: the sites Worker",
      "(apps.yonedarepo.com, *.yonedarepo.com), the AgentSandbox container app, the agent queues and",
      "the agent Worker's D1 and R2. The AI Gateway yonedarepo-prod (SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY) is not a",
      "kind prune knows; delete it by hand."
    ],
    "workers": [
      "yonedarepo-apps-dev",
      "yonedarepo-dev",
      "yonedarepo-prod-sites",
      "yonedarepo-sites-dev"
    ],
    "containers": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-executioncontainer",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-agentsandbox"
    ],
    "queues": [
      "yoneda-dev-agent",
      "yoneda-dev-capture",
      "yoneda-dev-dead-letter",
      "yoneda-dev-evaluate",
      "yoneda-dev-platform",
      "yoneda-dev-publish",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-agent",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-capture",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-dead-letter",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-evaluate"
    ],
    "d1": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-index",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-index"
    ],
    "r2": [
      "yonedarepo-dev-objects",
      "yonedarepo-prod-agents-objects"
    ],
    "artifacts": [
      "yoneda-dev"
    ]
  }
}
